'''Fun Guy''' is a [[transformation]] added in ''[[The Binding of Isaac: Afterbirth]]'', turning Isaac into a walking mushroom after picking up 3 mushroom-related items.

== Effects ==
* Grants one full [[Red Heart container]].

== Requirements ==
Pick up 3 [[item]]s from the following list ({{dlc|r}} with the [[Item Tags mushroom|{{code|mushroom}} tag]]).

=== Active Collectibles ===
{{collectible table | Mega Mush, Wavy Cap }}

=== Passive Collectibles ===
{{collectible table | 1up!, Blue Cap, God's Flesh, Magic Mushroom, Mini Mush, Mucormycosis, Odd Mushroom (Large), Odd Mushroom (Thin) }}

== Trivia ==
* The name Fun Guy is a slang term for psychedelic [[wikipedia:Psilocybin mushroom|Psilocybin mushrooms]] and a wordplay on "fungi".
* Fun Guy's appearance may be a reference to the character ''Toad'', a humanoid mushroom from the [[wikipedia:Super Mario|''Super Mario'']] franchise.
* When obtaining this transformation with [[Keeper]] or [[Tainted Keeper]], it will look different than with any other characters, as the mushroom in it's head will slightly bend at the bottom and it's face will look more scarecrow-ish, making their eyes and mouth get smaller and lower on their face.

